  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-09T05:43:25.758Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "the world menus in the new menu beta do not save the place you were at which was good to have with the old menu. closing the menu or even changing categories resets the position back to the top which can be annoying when world exploring. for instance maybe you want to find a world to go to next but dont want to place the portal yet, or even you accidentally close the menu before go8ng to that world. the way it is currently set up would require you to scroll all the way back through what you have already seen to get back to your place in the menu. I would much prefer the old way of your place in the lists being saved simply as a QOL improvement and time saver when exploring the new worlds.",
